This repository contains no copy of OpenCV source code. It does contain code
whose arithmetic, evaluation order and rounding were reproduced from OpenCV so
that the CUDA implementation can be checked for bit-exact agreement against a
host reference. The files concerned are recorded in docs/code-provenance.md.

